    "protocol": "public hipengine.LLM API, production profile, one 35-token suite prompt, max_tokens=1, third-iteration steady state, same build, HIPENGINE_GGUF_Q4_T16_SINGLE_WAVE_MAX_ROWS=0 to disable all three shapes",
